{"id":"wb-5-389","name":"五龙庙文昌阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"五龙庙文昌阁","text":"五龙庙文昌阁位于四川省阆中市河楼乡白虎村境内的五龙山麓，为一元代古建筑，1991年4月16日公布为四川省第三批文物保护单位。2001年6月25日列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n五龙庙始建于唐代，元代重建，庙内的文昌阁属四川地区保存不多的元代木结构建筑之一，历经明代清代多次维修，仍基本保留下了元代建筑的主体构架。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%94%E9%BE%99%E5%BA%99%E6%96%87%E6%98%8C%E9%98%81","revisionId":86590061,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86590061","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/39e2a9179081147afce8ecb5.jpg","title":"五龙庙文昌阁.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%94%E9%BE%99%E5%BA%99%E6%96%87%E6%98%8C%E9%98%81.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/%E4%BA%94%E9%BE%99%E5%BA%99%E6%96%87%E6%98%8C%E9%98%81.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Wenchang Hall of Wulong Temple, Langzhong, Sichuan","width":320,"height":213}}